---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config';
---
<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-20 bg-body">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl reveal" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-[3px] text-primary mb-2.5">About Me</p>
      <h2 class="text-[32px] font-bold text-white mb-3">Building things that matter</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3.5 text-base text-text-light leading-[1.8] max-w-[700px]">
        <p>
          I'm a full-stack developer with 2+ years of professional experience,
          specializing in React and Node.js with TypeScript. I previously worked
          with Ruby on Rails and pick up new stacks quickly when projects demand
          it.
        </p>
        <p>
          My most recent role was on the development team of an Electronic Lab
          Notebook (ELN) solution for a biotech company, where I built new
          features and maintained the existing product to streamline research
          workflows for scientists. I'm currently sharpening my skills through
          hands-on projects - including a Kanban board app and a coffee truck
          discovery platform for Israel - while actively seeking my next role.
        </p>
        <p>
          I leverage AI-assisted development tools - agentic workflows with
          Claude Code and Opencode, custom skills, and context-driven prompting -
          to design systems, debug efficiently, and maintain high test coverage.
          I treat them as a force multiplier, not a crutch.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm based in Petah Tikva, Israel, and always happy to chat about new
          opportunities, clean code, or what the market's doing today.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 reveal reveal-delay-2" data-reveal>
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-5 py-2 border border-border-accent text-primary rounded-md text-[13px] hover:bg-primary hover:text-dark-100 hover:border-primary transition-all duration-200 ease-out cursor-pointer active:scale-[0.98]">
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.linkedin}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-5 py-2 border border-border-accent text-primary rounded-md text-[13px] hover:bg-primary hover:text-dark-100 hover:border-primary transition-all duration-200 ease-out cursor-pointer active:scale-[0.98]">
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
